        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/086fe940150bb1bda8e6bd519a653abb.avif?t=1767575173\" width=823 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<u>moonchrome.</u>&quot;</strong> is a monochrome JRPG in which you travel to various locations to raise the moon and save a colorless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle system is a bit twisted, like solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The charming story is cute yet eerie, keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique world where the graphics, background music, and story were all created by a single artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/5057f3b750455447810352542bb29cf7.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=35 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>STORY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ghostly world, lost in color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As &quot;θ,&quot; the ninth stick figure born at the facility, you've been given the mission of saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pure and innocent self will single-mindedly fulfill your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what outcome awaits you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay time is roughly 6～12 hours! You can also play multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/0f71c1bd2a980af1ae69622caec4285b.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BATTLE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll encounter some crazy ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system in this game is a little strange, but you'll only need to learn four things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>1. Enemy colors change depending on the attacks you land!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>2. Use </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/8aa8801b2f23758fbed4c475c0f10934.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> attacks against </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/858b8392d6872c627f41a1bbc910c38c.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> enemies!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3. Use </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/858b8392d6872c627f41a1bbc910c38c.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <i><strong>attacks against </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/8aa8801b2f23758fbed4c475c0f10934.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> enemies!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>4. Combine attacks to increase damage!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's very simple, but it can get confusing as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trick is to call out the color of your current enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/e0a2f1d86bad19b5124682f10abf85c9.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Numerous Attractions</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chaotic worldview and design with a slightly eerie, horror-inspired feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based command battles where you alternate between two attribute abilities to &quot;continue to deal&quot; damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highly flexible exploration, with the ability to use two bodies to climb walls and squeeze through gaps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Only one ending. Whether it's happy or sad is up to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a variety of equipment and weapons using workbenches, anvils, furnaces, and other items scattered throughout the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A dark and dramatic story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Auto-save function</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>:About related works:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This work is a prequel to the cute and scary horror RPG &quot;Galeid.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, the relevance is minimal, so it's no problem even if you haven't played the previous work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>: WARNING:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains bugs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've fixed all major issues, but please back up your save data just in case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data locations: ↓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local files → &quot;app&quot; → &quot;save&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs, please contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll fix them within two weeks at the latest (minor issues excluded).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Please read the terms and conditions before streaming or creating derivative works!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moonchrome. welcomes live commentary, streaming, and derivative works!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can monetize live commentary and live streaming...but!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please read the terms and conditions of any linked websites before doing so!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keystrokes: (Changeable in Settings)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow keys = Move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>z = Confirm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>x = Cancel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift = Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>f = Sprint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTL = Incarnate Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc = Open/Close Menu</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/086fe940150bb1bda8e6bd519a653abb.avif?t=1767575173\" width=823 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<u>moonchrome.</u>&quot;</strong> is a monochrome JRPG in which you travel to various locations to raise the moon and save a colorless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle system is a bit twisted, like solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The charming story is cute yet eerie, keeping you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique world where the graphics, background music, and story were all created by a single artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/5057f3b750455447810352542bb29cf7.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=35 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>STORY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ghostly world, lost in color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As &quot;θ,&quot; the ninth stick figure born at the facility, you've been given the mission of saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pure and innocent self will single-mindedly fulfill your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what outcome awaits you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay time is roughly 6～12 hours! You can also play multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/0f71c1bd2a980af1ae69622caec4285b.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BATTLE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll encounter some crazy ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system in this game is a little strange, but you'll only need to learn four things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>1. Enemy colors change depending on the attacks you land!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>2. Use </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/8aa8801b2f23758fbed4c475c0f10934.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> attacks against </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/858b8392d6872c627f41a1bbc910c38c.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> enemies!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3. Use </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/858b8392d6872c627f41a1bbc910c38c.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <i><strong>attacks against </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/8aa8801b2f23758fbed4c475c0f10934.webp?t=1767575173\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong> enemies!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>4. Combine attacks to increase damage!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's very simple, but it can get confusing as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trick is to call out the color of your current enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083740/extras/e0a2f1d86bad19b5124682f10abf85c9.webp?t=1767575173\" width=674 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Numerous Attractions</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chaotic worldview and design with a slightly eerie, horror-inspired feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based command battles where you alternate between two attribute abilities to &quot;continue to deal&quot; damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highly flexible exploration, with the ability to use two bodies to climb walls and squeeze through gaps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Only one ending. Whether it's happy or sad is up to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Craft a variety of equipment and weapons using workbenches, anvils, furnaces, and other items scattered throughout the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A dark and dramatic story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Auto-save function</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>:About related works:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This work is a prequel to the cute and scary horror RPG &quot;Galeid.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, the relevance is minimal, so it's no problem even if you haven't played the previous work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>: WARNING:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains bugs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've fixed all major issues, but please back up your save data just in case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data locations: ↓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local files → &quot;app&quot; → &quot;save&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs, please contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll fix them within two weeks at the latest (minor issues excluded).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Please read the terms and conditions before streaming or creating derivative works!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moonchrome. welcomes live commentary, streaming, and derivative works!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can monetize live commentary and live streaming...but!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please read the terms and conditions of any linked websites before doing so!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keystrokes: (Changeable in Settings)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow keys = Move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>z = Confirm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>x = Cancel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift = Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>f = Sprint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTL = Incarnate Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc = Open/Close Menu</strong></p>",
